				<wikidot:authorName>DrRoyal</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2731397</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I love this kind of story. &quot;The Foundation is cold, not cruel.&quot; It kind of demonstrates the cold, heartless scientific demeanor of the Foundation.</p> <p>I personally often see the Foundation as the &quot;bad guys&quot;. I mean, I guess it's necessary, just like bombs that end wars. But yet&#8230;</p> 
