					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-307808#post-1001786</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-307808/decency#post-1001786</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 14 Feb 2011 05:45:13 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Chubert</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>502908</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>What the hell does it say about us that a story about a man wanting to show a girl that somebody cares about her that ends in:</p> <p>1. The man being shot<br /> 2. The girl's memory being wiped<br /> 3. The girl herself having [DATA EXPUNGED].</p> <p>is cliche? At this point, it would take godly writing to give any sort of happy ending to 231-7.</p> <p>Well, I like it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
